    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [x] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [x] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n- [x] I have updated 'mini.nvim' to latest version of the `main` branch\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.files\n\n### Neovim version\n\n0.11 (!at least latest Nightly build!)\n\n### Description\n\n```lua\nopts = \n  mappings = {\n    close =  { 'q', '<Esc>' }\n  }\n}\n```\n### Reproduction\n\nI want to add multiple keys to the same action, just want to align with the operations with other plugins, however this is not allowed in \"mini.files\", can you add such functionality? Thank you!",
