            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "This is already possible with 'mini.files'. See #1309, #879, #534, or #409.\n\nI'd also *highly* recommend to not use `<Esc>` to close explorer, because making regular buffer edits (in Insert mode which is usually exited with `<Esc>`) is a big part of 'mini.files' functionality.",
